    "demo": "Glass Current: original synthesized audio, four audio tracks, four MIDI tracks, two buses and an Atmosphere volume automation lane; 32 bars at 120 BPM.",
    "instrument": "No VST3 instrument is assigned in this capture: the MIDI tracks show RILL's real unassigned state (Choose instrument… in the piano roll, MIDI · None in the mixer). The 8 November capture used Surge XT 1.3.4.",
    "setup": "Pointer input fits the timelines, opens the Glass chords / Opening · glass chords clip, sets the editor key to D, opens the Kick clip with the Cursor tool, opens the Atmosphere · Volume automation editor and the Mixer, and types an unsent request into the assistant. No provider credentials, AI request, generated reply or AI song edit is used; Connect AI remains visible.",
    "harness": "Not used for this capture; scripts/rill-capture/capture-harness.patch targets the 8 November revision.",
